      },
      "message": "Reference Model: Output per-entry suppression bits from rule analyzer\n\nInstead of updating global suppression signals, this commit adds sie/see\nas output signals of rule analyzer. If the checked entry matches request\naddress range, the sie/see signals are per-entry suppression bits of the\nentry according to requested permission. If per-entry suppression is not\nsupprted, the output signals are always 0 (no suppresion).",
