      "message": "Reference Model: Refactor processing of per-entry suppression bits\n\nSince the output of per-entry suppression bits from matched entry are in\noutput signals of the rule analyzer, we don't need global singals in\niopmp_dev_t structure. Replacing global signals with local ones. The\noperations are also refactored to be similar with what specification\ndefines to improve readability.\n\nA bug that leaving out ERR_CFG.ie when determing interrupt should be\ngenerated or not is also fixed.",
